rovide oral instructions, to read, comprehend, follow and provide written instructions, information, etc., and to perform basic mathematical functions such as counting and reading scales. 10. Grill or carve food as required. Requires the physical ability to walk and/or stand for extended periods of time, lift, reach, finger, crouch, feel, push, pull, stoop, and exert up to 35 pounds of force unassisted. Task requires the visual ability to read menus and thermometers, perceive depth, distinguish color, etc. Task requires the use of grills and servery equipment, knives, thermometer, arm protectors, gloves, etc. Employee is exposed to inside environmental conditions, extreme heat, etc. Task requires the mental ability to receive, comprehend, follow and provide oral instructions and information, and to read, comprehend, follow and provide written instructions, information, etc. 11. Obtain supplies from storage areas. Requires the physical ability to finger, crouch, reach, stand, walk, lift, grasp, feel, push, pull, stoop, balance, and exert up to 35 pounds of force unassisted. Task requires the visual ability to read food labels and lists of needed food, perceive depth, etc. Task requires the use of carts, etc. Employee is exposed to inside environmental conditions. Task requires the mental ability to receive, comprehend, follow and provide oral instructions and information, and to read, comprehend, follow and provide written instructions, information, etc. 12. Assist with laundry program. Requires the physical ability to finger, crouch, reach, stand, walk, lift, grasp, feel, push, pull, stoop, balance, and exert up to 35 pounds of force unassisted. Task requires the visual ability to read directions on working compounds and MSDS forms, distinguish color, perceive depth, etc. Task requires the use of washing machines, dryer, laundry cart, cleaning compounds, gloves, goggles, mask, etc. Employee is exposed to inside environmental conditions, chemicals, etc. Task requires